    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Groundskeeper is 2D top down indie horror featuring a retro pixel style for a delightful and retro spooky vibe. Step into Gramen Park, conduct your nightly rounds and keep an eye on things from the warmth of your security hut. But do beware, there's something sinister lurking inside...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Groundskeeper you take on the nightshift with a job to keep Gramen Park in shape and protected. Armed with a task list and a tool shed you'll be quickly interrupted by pesky teenagers who will make your life more difficult and a faulty generator that plunges you into darkness. A darkness that may reveal a more sinister force at work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D horror-adventure featuring exploration and action elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressions of violence and pixelated gore</p></li></ul>",
